\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A neatly-kept ledger, recording all shipments leaving for the docks. Entries record goods of all sorts, bound for ships that will carry them the length of the Sword Coast and even further afield. Some logs carry specific notes such as 'Handle with Care - Delicate Cargo', 'Keep Dry', and 'Remember to Feed Daily'.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715013510\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1352/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24002/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6009/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936111/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.867      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   37.867      1 -total\n 49.51%   18.748      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.81%   16.588     15 Template:Trim\n 23.65%    8.957      2 Template:Uid\n 16.79%    6.358      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.14%    5.356      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.15%    3.842      1 Template:Books\n  9.51%    3.602      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.47%    3.584      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47104-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715013510 and revision id 336332. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}